+<dd><tt>Returns&nbsp;the&nbsp;string&nbsp;after&nbsp;a&nbsp;.&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;name,&nbsp;or&nbsp;the&nbsp;full&nbsp;name&nbsp;otherwise.</tt></dd>
+</dl>
+</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><p>
